Field Review - Addition / Alteration - Exterior alterations to this existing three dwelling units with a detached accessory building on this site.

The scope includes:
1. Revised rear yard pathway;
2. Revised unit 3 access stair configuration and stair material;
3. Revised LPT location on site plan;
4. Proposed BC hydro pad outside property;
5. Added electrical closet to accessory building;
6. Updated Landscape plan;
7. Removed grasscrete parking;

related to DP-2023-00409
OK for Field Review per J. Zhang March 18, 2024

Note:
This permit is for alterations as shown in plans only. Any unauthorized work on this site, existing or otherwise, is neither recognized nor approved and may be subject to enforcement action.

High Density Housing / Commercial - Addition / Alteration - To perform interior and exterior alterations and an addition to this existing rental building, by increasing the number of dwelling units by three and to include an amenity room on the main floor. Scope of work includes new sprinklers to the new units and upgrading of fire alarm system.

Note: 
1.0. Reviewed under VBBL 2019.
2.0. Project types will be rehabilitation and addition and category of works will be major renovation  and minor horizontal addition and most stringent upgrading triggers are F2, S2, N3 and A3.

